      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Thats wierd though because i tested it again just now ingame with an overrideController instead of a animatorController directly, and it all works like i would expect. Just turns out it doesnt actually take the clips from the override as one would expect. But besides that it all works fine. So it would be cool if it actually could get fully supported. Since it seems to work for most of the things already.",
