      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: it would be a nice feature to support, as it would allow people to reuse the same controller fur multiple avatars, swapping out single animation clips that are avatar-specific, and keeping the general shape of the controller. \nSure, making a copy of the controller and then changing it is an approach, but then if you later find an issue in the controller, you'll have to go through all the copies and fix it, instead of fixing just one base controller.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
